<title>USA: St Lucie Cty, Fla., $29 mln repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>St Lucie Cty, Fla., $29 mln repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>William R Hough &amp; Co said Monday it repriced St Lucie County, Fla.'s $29 million school bond deal, lowering yields five basis points in the 2005 through 2007 maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>ST. LUCIE COUNTY FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: $29,000,000*</p>
<p>SCHOOL DISTRICT GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>FULLY REGISTERED</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>    FGIC			   UNDERLYING A3/A</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>    DATED: 02/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 08/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 02/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>02/01/1998		2,395M    4.00  %	  3.60</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 100.361)</p>
<p>02/01/1999		2,490M    3.90  %	  3.95</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.905)</p>
<p>02/01/2000		2,585M    4.10  %	  4.20</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.724)</p>
<p>02/01/2001		2,695M    4.25  %	  4.30</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.818)</p>
<p>02/01/2002		2,810M    4.30  %	  4.40</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.558)</p>
<p>02/01/2003		2,930M    4.40  %	  4.50</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.481)</p>
<p>02/01/2004		3,060M    4.50  %	  4.60</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.409)</p>
<p>02/01/2005		3,195M    4.60  %	  4.65</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.668)</p>
<p>02/01/2006		3,340M    4.65  %	  4.75</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.275)</p>
<p>02/01/2007		3,500M    5.875 %	  4.85</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 108    )</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Tuesday, February 11, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on February 25, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is not book entry.</p>
<p>This issue is clearing through DTC.</p>
<p>William R. Hough &amp; Co.</p>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc.</p>
<p>SunTrust Capital Markets, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
